{"id":"5142","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5142_main_stratus-nebulosus-with-precipitation_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>层云通常是灰色的云层，具有相当均匀的底部，可能产生毛毛雨、雪或米雪。在这张图片中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">灰色的云几乎没有形态</span>，可将其确定为雾状云种。云非常密集足以遮挡太阳，因此我们也可以将其 确定为蔽光云云类。它也非常密集以产生降水性附加特征，这可以通过<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白色斑点（雪花）</span>看出。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jüri Kamenik","location":"爱沙尼亚塔林Pääsküla","latitude":"纬度: 59° 21' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 37' 55'' E","date":"06 December 2014 1407 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.6"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5142_syn_stratus-nebulosus-with-precipitation_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC的天气图显示了葡萄牙亚速尔群岛附近的高压以及冰岛附近和斯堪的纳维亚北部的低压中心。波罗的海国家处于暖区条件下。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5142_upper_stratus-nebulosus-with-precipitation_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>爱沙尼亚塔林（WMO 26038）在0000 UTC时的探测表明从地面到约870 hPa（1200秘）的空气非常潮湿。在900 hPa（750米）处出现超过6°C的急剧逆温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5142_radar_stratus-nebulosus-with-precipitation_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>雷达图像显示爱沙尼亚塔林市西北部有轻微降水的小回波。照片位置未显示出降水，其中水凝物太稀疏或太低而不能被雷达波束捕获。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 爱沙尼亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5496_main_stratus-nebulosus-opacus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>层云通常为灰色云层，云底相当均匀，可能会带来毛毛雨、雪或米雪。图中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云呈均匀灰色，无清晰的形状</span>，可将其确定为薄幕云种。它十分浓密，无法看到太阳，可确定为蔽光云类。由于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛毛雨将能见度降至</span>大约3公里，因而我们还可增加降水性附加特征。大约在拍摄照片时，云幂仪测得的云底高度为60-120米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 10' 14'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 54' 54'' E","date":"17 September 2007 0929 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.6 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.6 1"}]}]}